# The live configuration: real school, upstream host, and whatever secrets the
# deployment keeps here. The Dockerfile only COPYs cmd/ and internal/, so it
# never reaches a layer, but the build context is uploaded to the daemon whole —
# which matters the moment the build runs on a remote or rootless builder.
